sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant W as Web App
    participant A as Orders API
    participant P as Payment Provider
    U->>W: Place order
    W->>+A: POST /orders
    A->>+P: Charge card
    P-->>-A: Charge result
    alt payment accepted
        A-->>W: 201 order id
    else payment declined
        A-->>-W: 402 declined
    end
    W-->>U: Show confirmation
